```Why is traffic not being inspected? Splits handshake failures (likely pinning/mTLS) from policy bypasses.```
index=proxy sourcetype=ssl_bypass:csv earliest=-14d
| lookup app_inventory domain AS dest OUTPUT app owner
| lookup bypass_exceptions domain AS dest OUTPUT reason AS exc_reason expires ticket
| eval exc_state=case(isnull(expires), "NO_EXCEPTION",
                      strptime(expires,"%Y-%m-%d") < now(), "EXPIRED",
                      true(), "VALID")
| stats count AS sessions dc(user) AS users values(tls_version) AS tls
        values(bypass_reason) AS reasons
        BY app dest ssl_result exc_state
| sort - sessions
